        "title": "Chameleon: Mixed-Modal Early-Fusion Foundation Models",
        "relevance": "Primary reference for unified multimodal architecture",
        "key_contributions": [
          "Early-fusion token-based mixed-modal models",
          "All modalities as discrete tokens (images, text, code)",
          "Uniform Transformer trained end-to-end on interleaved data",
